# Branding Customization — PLACEHOLDER
#
# Camoufox already includes complete branding in:
#   additions/browser/branding/camoufox/
#
# To customize branding for BrowserOS:
# 1. Place custom assets in packages/camoufox/branding/
# 2. Update apply-patches.sh to copy branding files:
#    cp -r "$PATCHES_DIR/../branding/"* "$FIREFOX_SRC/browser/branding/camoufox/"
#
# Assets to customize:
#   - firefox.icns          — macOS app icon
#   - firefox64.ico         — Windows app icon
#   - default*.png          — Toolbar icons (16, 22, 24, 32, 48, 64, 128, 256)
#   - content/about-logo*   — About page logos
#   - locales/en-US/brand.* — Brand name strings
#
# For now, keeping Camoufox default branding.
